  "translate_en|mods/SauceTooltips/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ST_OptVanillaCoreTooltip": "Re-emit vanilla's own tooltip rows through the chrome pipeline so the whole card gets sections, leaders and gauges. Verified per item class against the real game every session; any mismatch falls back to vanilla rows automatically. Turn off to always use vanilla's built-in rows.",
